{isPump && (
<section class="section" aria-label="Well pump replacement cost">
<p class="section-eyebrow">Cost explainer</p><h2>What a well pump replacement actually costs</h2>
<div class="svc-grid">
<div class="svc"><h3>Around $1,900 — typical</h3><p>Most Central Florida homeowners pay around $1,900 for a standard submersible pump replacement: pump, labor, and hookup included.</p></div>
<div class="svc"><h3>Less — simple jobs</h3><p>Shallower wells, smaller pumps, and jobs where the pressure tank and switch are still healthy can land below the typical price.</p></div>
<div class="svc"><h3>More — deep or bundled</h3><p>Deep wells, larger pumps, or a tank-and-pump job done together run above it. Your quote should itemize every part before work starts.</p></div>
</div></section>
)}
<section class="section" aria-label="Well services">
<p class="section-eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Well services, handled by local pros</h2>
<div class="svc-grid">
<a class="svc" href={`${base}/well-pump-replacement/`}><span class="svc-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 3c2.8 3.4 5.2 6.6 5.2 9.5a5.2 5.2 0 1 1-10.4 0C6.8 9.6 9.2 6.4 12 3z" stroke="#0a7d99" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9.4 13a2.8 2.8 0 0 0 1.8 3" stroke="#0fb5c9" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><h3>Well Pump Replacement</h3><p>The $1,900 job, quoted straight: pump, labor, and any tank or switch work itemized before work starts.</p><span class="svc-link">Pump costs &amp; signs →</span></a>
<a class="svc" href={`${base}/well-repair/`}><span class="svc-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 5.9-4L18 4.9l1.6 1.6 2.6-2.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1-5.6 5.6L8 18.1a2 2 0 0 1-2.8 0l-1.4-1.4a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.8l8.6-8.6a4.4 4.4 0 0 1 2.3 1z" fill="#0a7d99" transform="scale(.92) translate(1 1)"/></svg></span><h3>Well Repair</h3><p>No water, low pressure, short-cycling, sandy water — diagnosed first, so a $200 switch never becomes a pump job.</p><span class="svc-link">Repair services →</span></a>
<a class="svc" href={`${base}/well-drilling/`}><span class="svc-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2v13" stroke="#0a7d99" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 9l5 6 5-6" stroke="#0fb5c9" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M4 21h16" stroke="#0a7d99" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M6 17.5h12" stroke="#9fdcea" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><h3>Well Drilling</h3><p>New wells and full well replacement, permitted and drilled for Central Florida's sand and water table.</p><span class="svc-link">Drilling &amp; permits →</span></a>
<a class="svc" href={`${base}/get-a-quote/`}><span class="svc-icon"><svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" stroke="#0a7d99" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M12 13l4.2-4.2" stroke="#0fb5c9" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="1.8" fill="#0a7d99"/><path d="M3 20h18" stroke="#0a7d99" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span><h3>No Water / Low Pressure</h3><p>Woke up to dry taps or fading pressure? Mark it urgent on the form and your request goes to the front of the line.</p><span class="svc-link">Get help fast →</span></a>
</div></section>
<section class="section" aria-label="How it works">
<p class="section-eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Fixed in three steps</h2>
<div class="steps">
<div class="step"><span class="step-num">1</span><h3>Request</h3><p>Tell us what your water is doing — no water, low pressure, an aging pump — in one short form. It takes a minute.</p></div>
<div class="step"><span class="step-num">2</span><h3>Matched</h3><p>We match you with a licensed local well contractor who serves your community, with your symptoms already in hand.</p></div>
